      {
        "unit_id": "snapshot-unit:533db57d78cb2d1335159a30423fb6addfdd072c62f5cdab4702a3d9b6715da8",
        "chunk_id": "chunk:signed-non-table-target-scope",
        "kind": "prose",
        "locator": "body[1]",
        "text": "有个OCS的快速看一下，渗透率反正都是吹牛的，都没准数的。29年NPO到10%，CPO到30%，可插拔主导70%。",
        "text_sha256": "sha256:18cc5c6c06ae3b5ab8cb84af6f770d1fbfc28aac1cfd4279db9d249e97f57972",
        "span": {
          "coordinate_system": "unicode_code_points",
          "text_sha256": "sha256:18cc5c6c06ae3b5ab8cb84af6f770d1fbfc28aac1cfd4279db9d249e97f57972",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 57
        },
        "metadata": {
          "reader_kind": "paragraph",
          "source_text_sha256": "18cc5c6c06ae3b5ab8cb84af6f770d1fbfc28aac1cfd4279db9d249e97f57972",
          "gold_not_exposed_to_model": true,
