      {
        "unit_id": "snapshot-unit:1a4bd4ce5b264c454e63bcc01e3edd2a8ecabb125218302ad8ea5b509876ccb2",
        "chunk_id": "chunk:signed-non-table-target-scope",
        "kind": "prose",
        "locator": "body[43]",
        "text": "剑桥呢在送样方面，他们通常会经历一个为期六个月的实验室认证，之后再小批量。整个流程下来最终拿到订单可能需要1年到1年半时间。",
        "text_sha256": "sha256:79d9507f1045be3b571c97e2089b399f159a914b4fd14f8305cea2155b9290fe",
        "span": {
          "coordinate_system": "unicode_code_points",
          "text_sha256": "sha256:79d9507f1045be3b571c97e2089b399f159a914b4fd14f8305cea2155b9290fe",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 62
